WeSpeakerEmbedding (VoxStudio vendored module)

ResNet34 network and weight loading adapted from soniqo/speech-swift
(Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE).

VoxStudio changes:
- Kaldi FBank front end matching torchaudio.compliance.kaldi.fbank as configured by
  pyannote.audio WeSpeaker models: int16-scaled input, snip_edges, per-frame DC
  removal and pre-emphasis, Hamming window, Kaldi mel banks (20 Hz–Nyquist), log
  with float epsilon floor, then per-utterance mean normalization.
- Statistics pooling with unbiased standard deviation (pyannote StatsPool).

Model weights (WeSpeaker ResNet34-LM) are not part of this module.
